      <segment>
        <source>Basic</source>
        <target state="translated">基礎用法</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="2" name="BasicDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The most basic usage of Transfer involves providing the source data and target keys arrays, plus the rendering and some callback functions.</source>
        <target state="translated">Transfer 的基礎用法需要提供源數據、目標 keys 數組，以及渲染和部分回調函數。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
